## 5. Evidence

Minimal proof only — enough to prove the defect, never a bulk data pull. Note what was
redacted and why.

## 6. Impact

What an attacker actually gains. Tie every sentence to something demonstrated in §4/§5.
Speculative escalation belongs in §7, clearly labelled as untested.

